WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:01.579
&gt;&gt;&gt; Tonight, a special treat.

00:00:01.579 --> 00:00:07.310
Former California governor and action star
Arnold schwarzenegger sat down with Dana bash

00:00:07.310 --> 00:00:12.190
to talk about how he's combatted rising antisemitism
and hate crimes in America.

00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:14.139
Dana, I'm envious.

00:00:14.139 --> 00:00:15.450
What a privilege you've had.

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:16.960
I've been in his company before.

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:20.609
He is really interesting.

00:00:20.609 --> 00:00:21.710
&gt;&gt; No question about it.

00:00:21.710 --> 00:00:23.260
And especially on this topic.

00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:26.140
He invited me here to los Angeles to usc.

00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:31.580
He has schwarzenegger institute set up there
to focus on public policy.

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:33.980
And broadly, about bringing people together.

00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:37.540
His focus lately has been about combatting
hate.

00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:41.020
He called this forum a terminating hate.

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:43.000
I'm sure you get that.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:48.021
And the whole idea was to bring people together
like a former skin head, which he did, and

00:00:48.021 --> 00:00:54.300
a rabbi was there, to have a conversation
across lines, among people that don't normally

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:55.300
have

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:56.300
[9:36:37 PM]

00:00:56.300 --> 00:01:02.220
people that don't normally have these conversations,
and his personal connection to this was fascinating.

00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:04.850
&gt;&gt; You have worn so many hats in your lifetime.

00:01:04.850 --> 00:01:08.820
A body builder, movie star, governor of California.

00:01:08.820 --> 00:01:13.550
You're using this chapter of your life to
speak out against hate.

00:01:13.550 --> 00:01:16.509
Against antisemitism in particular.

00:01:16.509 --> 00:01:17.509
Why?

00:01:17.509 --> 00:01:24.439
&gt;&gt; Well, it's not this particular -- it's
like anything that I see that really bothers

00:01:24.439 --> 00:01:26.650
me, I get involved with it.

00:01:26.650 --> 00:01:33.290
If it is the fight against fossil fuels, a
cleaner environment, motivating people to

00:01:33.290 --> 00:01:39.930
get up and become successful, or if it is
prejudice and hatred that I've seen over the

00:01:39.930 --> 00:01:42.009
years rise.

00:01:42.009 --> 00:01:45.820
So it became kind of alarming to me.

00:01:45.820 --> 00:01:50.110
You don't have to just sit there and watch
this whole thing.

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:54.390
I think that you can get involved and use
your platform to speak out about it because

00:01:54.390 --> 00:01:55.390
of

00:01:55.390 --> 00:01:56.390
[9:37:39 PM]

00:01:56.390 --> 00:01:58.340
to speak out about it because of my history.

00:01:58.340 --> 00:02:03.900
I come from a country that was part of the
second World War.

00:02:03.900 --> 00:02:07.600
Austria, hitler himself was part Austrian.

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:12.250
And it is all because we let this grow.

00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:15.760
This antisemitism and this hatred.

00:02:15.760 --> 00:02:21.220
So I come from a place that has been done
once before.

00:02:21.220 --> 00:02:25.319
And I don't want that to happen again.

00:02:25.319 --> 00:02:29.629
&gt;&gt; You stood up at this forum and you said
--

00:02:29.629 --> 00:02:38.129
&gt;&gt; And I was born with a father that was a
Nazi.

00:02:38.129 --> 00:02:39.300
Think about that.

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:41.410
&gt;&gt; The air went out of the room.

00:02:41.410 --> 00:02:46.290
I've heard you talk about your father but
not like that.

00:02:46.290 --> 00:02:51.280
What made you say it that way?

00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:56.340
&gt;&gt; You have to understand, when I improvise
a speech, I don't think about how I say something

00:02:56.340 --> 00:02:57.340
[9:38:40 PM]

00:02:57.340 --> 00:02:58.340
think about how I say something or what I
say.

00:02:58.340 --> 00:03:06.640
&gt;&gt; You used the story of your father to try
to reach people who are getting sucked into

00:03:06.640 --> 00:03:11.730
groups that propagate hate.

00:03:11.730 --> 00:03:14.900
Talk about making that connection?

00:03:14.900 --> 00:03:24.500
&gt;&gt; My father was, and so many other millions
of men were sucked into a hate system through

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:33.200
lies and deceits, and so we have seen where
that leads.

00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:36.470
I've seen firsthand how broken those men were.

00:03:36.470 --> 00:03:40.330
The kind of atrocities happened.

00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:45.590
How many millions of people had to die and
then they ended up losers.

00:03:45.590 --> 00:03:47.000
The confederacy loses.

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:51.580
They say, oh, this just doesn't work.

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:59.090
Let's just go and get along and love is more
powerful than hate.

00:03:59.090 --> 00:04:00.090
[9:39:42 PM]

00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:01.090
love is more powerful than hate.

00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:04.860
&gt;&gt; In this video that did you last month --
&gt;&gt; I want to talk today about the rising hate

00:04:04.860 --> 00:04:07.999
and anti-semitism we've seen all over the
world.

00:04:07.999 --> 00:04:12.430
&gt;&gt; Reporter: Which was incredibly powerful
and has been seen how many times now?

00:04:12.430 --> 00:04:17.150
&gt;&gt; Apparently, at least 100 million people
saw it.

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:21.010
And billions of impressions.

00:04:21.010 --> 00:04:28.900
&gt;&gt; You drew this parallel between participating
in Nazi hate during World War II and hateful

00:04:28.900 --> 00:04:31.860
ideology that is growing in the U.S.

00:04:31.860 --> 00:04:32.860
Now.

00:04:32.860 --> 00:04:36.409
Is that the path America is on right now?

00:04:36.409 --> 00:04:41.960
&gt;&gt; I don't know if it is the path that we're
on but I notice the danger.

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:47.110
&gt;&gt; You put out another video after January
6th, 2021, and you compared the storming of

00:04:47.110 --> 00:04:56.880
the capitol to crystal night when Nazis burned
synagogues, jewish businesses and homes.

00:04:56.880 --> 00:04:57.880
About 30,000 jewish men were

00:04:57.880 --> 00:04:58.880
[9:40:42 PM]

00:04:58.880 --> 00:04:59.880
About 30,000 jewish men were taken.

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:00.990
That was the beginning of it.

00:05:00.990 --> 00:05:03.490
What did you mean by that?

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:10.810
What did you see on January 6th that reminded
you of the beginning of years of hatred and

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:15.580
killing in Germany and Austria?

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:21.990
&gt;&gt; The first thing that came to my mind when
I saw the insurrection that this is very dangerous.

00:05:21.990 --> 00:05:26.600
It is a wake-up call to let people know, you
have to take this seriously.

00:05:26.600 --> 00:05:31.030
Not just like let's get those right wingers,
put them to jail.

00:05:31.030 --> 00:05:32.100
No.

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:34.449
This is much more than that.

00:05:34.449 --> 00:05:36.960
What creates something like that?

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:47.460
And sadly, I have to say, that no one really
has covered it well.

00:05:47.460 --> 00:05:48.460
The insurrection.

00:05:48.460 --> 00:05:53.509
Because they only said what they did was wrong
and they have to go to jail and punish them.

00:05:53.509 --> 00:05:57.690
But no one really has gotten into why was
it that way?

00:05:57.690 --> 00:05:58.690
[9:41:43 PM]

00:05:58.690 --> 00:06:01.060
into why was it that way?

00:06:01.060 --> 00:06:09.490
What powers do people have that are really
upset and angry with government?

00:06:09.490 --> 00:06:13.820
&gt;&gt; Part of it is that they were told the election
in 2020 was stolen.

00:06:13.820 --> 00:06:22.030
&gt;&gt; But remember that it is always kind of
the straw that breaks the camel's back.

00:06:22.030 --> 00:06:25.349
So it's not that that would drive anyone to
Washington.

00:06:25.349 --> 00:06:29.220
I think it was an unbelievable dissatisfaction.

00:06:29.220 --> 00:06:34.300
There is so much anger.

00:06:34.300 --> 00:06:36.000
&gt;&gt; You said history shouldn't repeat itself.

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:41.770
Donald Trump is now the front runner to be
the nominee of your party, the Republican

00:06:41.770 --> 00:06:42.870
party.

00:06:42.870 --> 00:06:46.360
Given everything you said, does that concern
you?

00:06:46.360 --> 00:06:48.500
&gt;&gt; Absolutely not.

00:06:48.500 --> 00:06:57.310
Being the front runner of one party and letting
them dig this hole deeper and deeper is going

00:06:57.310 --> 00:06:59.599
to make it easy for the Democrats to win.

00:06:59.599 --> 00:07:00.599
[9:42:45 PM]

00:07:00.599 --> 00:07:01.599
Democrats to win.

00:07:01.599 --> 00:07:02.599
It is sad to see that.

00:07:02.599 --> 00:07:12.050
That they couldn't come up with a new talent,
a new face that is a reasonable, smart, intelligent

00:07:12.050 --> 00:07:17.129
person that can lead this country in a Republican
way.

00:07:17.129 --> 00:07:19.990
&gt;&gt; Do you think there's no way he would win
again?

00:07:19.990 --> 00:07:21.500
&gt;&gt; No.

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:22.659
&gt;&gt; What if he did?

00:07:22.659 --> 00:07:25.600
&gt;&gt; What a question.

00:07:25.600 --> 00:07:30.410
I can guarantee you that he will go maybe
get the Republican nomination.

00:07:30.410 --> 00:07:33.699
Then when it come down to the actual election.

00:07:33.699 --> 00:07:39.030
There are too many people now that have seen
what he did as president.

00:07:39.030 --> 00:07:45.310
I think when it comes to the majority on election
day, I think they will see the difference

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:46.610
between one or the other.

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:51.699
That believe me, I'm not the first one to
say, this is really great to have Biden back

00:07:51.699 --> 00:07:52.699
as president.

00:07:52.699 --> 00:07:53.699
No.

00:07:53.699 --> 00:07:56.939
There's no better option, the way it looks
like now.

00:07:56.939 --> 00:07:59.199
&gt;&gt; Connecting this back to January 6th.

00:07:59.199 --> 00:08:00.669
[9:43:45 PM]

00:08:00.669 --> 00:08:02.139
January 6th.

00:08:02.139 --> 00:08:07.490
You say the country, you were leader, the
governor of a very big state.

00:08:07.490 --> 00:08:13.430
How do you reach those people when they are
listening to the lies of the 2020 election

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:17.949
and a leader who is perpetuating that still?

00:08:17.949 --> 00:08:20.820
&gt;&gt; They will be buying into it because they
want to.

00:08:20.820 --> 00:08:22.600
Even when you hear the evidence.

00:08:22.600 --> 00:08:32.050
For instance, fox, with tucker Carlson being
fired, by spreading the wrong news, and fox

00:08:32.050 --> 00:08:35.140
going to court because they've lied intentionally.

00:08:35.140 --> 00:08:38.080
Not mistakenly, intentionally.

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:42.479
Over and over again about this.

00:08:42.479 --> 00:08:47.420
People hear that but it doesn't mean anything
because they just want to believe the election

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:48.560
was stolen.

00:08:48.560 --> 00:08:49.560
Because trump is their man.

00:08:49.560 --> 00:08:55.589
&gt;&gt; And that relates to the hate that you're
trying to stop and the, kind of the temperature

00:08:55.589 --> 00:08:58.019
you're trying to help bring down in this country.

00:08:58.019 --> 00:08:59.440
How do you do that?

00:08:59.440 --> 00:09:00.530
&gt;&gt; It's not just that.

00:09:00.530 --> 00:09:01.530
[9:44:47 PM]

00:09:01.530 --> 00:09:04.920
&gt;&gt; It's not just that.

00:09:04.920 --> 00:09:08.100
Prejudice and hate goes in so many directions.

00:09:08.100 --> 00:09:14.250
It is not if you believe the trump election
was stolen or not.

00:09:14.250 --> 00:09:16.930
It has nothing to do with trump.

00:09:16.930 --> 00:09:23.810
It has to do with just in general, all over
the world, we have this problem now that there

00:09:23.810 --> 00:09:25.620
is this hate and prejudice.

00:09:25.620 --> 00:09:35.990
We are talking about white against black,
black against white, immigrants, it's just,

00:09:35.990 --> 00:09:38.940
you know, he's from over there and he's a
Muslim and he's a Jew

